CloudBurrow patch 34 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1466). Applies after patch 0022; needs
googlesqlite patch 0044.

CloudBurrow's front advances its own clock in tests (POST
/cloudburrow/bigquery/v2/clock:advance); the engine's clock was the
system's, so CURRENT_TIMESTAMP() and the times of a table's change
history read another clock than the front's. The patch serves POST
/cloudburrow/clock {"offsetNanos": n}, which sets the engine's clock
offset (googlesqlite.SetClockOffset), and the front sets it to its own
offset each time it advances.

